# A Beaked Blusterer (abyssea 176): a level 99 Warrior in South Gustaberg by the Cavernous Maw with The Truth Beckons
# completed and Dawn of Death accepted (GMs), no Traverser Stone, 6 maw quests completed (A Goldstruck Gigas, To Paste a
# Peiste, Megadrile Menace, The Beast of Bastore, A Delectable Demon, A Fluttery Fiend) and A Man-eating Mite accepted
# (GMs; an accepted one does not count). The maw, no stone: no section: its own warp event 914 (entranceMawOnTrigger),
# finished on option 0: no warp. Traverser Stone 1 (a GM, one stone: `>= 1`): 0 (a Progress), finished on option 0:
# begun. Back to available (a GM): the maw again with no other talk between: 0 again (an Event-rank 0 would alternate
# with the maw's own onTrigger: 914), finished on option 2: begun (any option). Accepted: the maw: no handler: 914. A
# zone-in, accepted with no Bennu title: nothing. The title (a GM): the zone-in plays 1 (left open); its update on
# option 0 and on option 2: nothing; on option 1: updateEvent(the key item for 6 completed: Lunar Abyssite III);
# finished: Lunar Abyssite III given, then completed. Completed (title, stone and Dawn of Death still held): a zone-in:
# nothing; the maw: 914.
lists SouthGustaberg/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger SouthGustaberg/onEventFinish/0 SouthGustaberg/onEventFinish/914 SouthGustaberg/onZoneIn/1 SouthGustaberg/onEventUpdate/1 SouthGustaberg/onEventFinish/1
char zone=SouthGustaberg pos=341.5,-0.5,-680 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace completed
quest Abyssea.TheBeastOfBastore completed
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon completed
quest Abyssea.AFlutteryFiend completed
quest Abyssea.AManEatingMite accepted
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # no stone: no section: the maw's warp event 914
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
keyitem TraverserStone1                 # a GM: one stone
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # available, one stone, Dawn of Death accepted: 0
finish                                  # option 0: begun
quest Abyssea.ABeakedBlusterer available # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # 0 again (the kind)
finish option=2                         # begun (any option)
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # accepted: no maw handler: 914
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
rezone                                  # accepted, no title: nothing
title BennuDeplumer                     # a GM
rezone open                             # the title: 1, left open
update 1 option=0                       # option 0: nothing
update 1 option=2                       # option 2: nothing
update 1 option=1                       # option 1: updateEvent(Lunar Abyssite III)
finish                                  # Lunar Abyssite III given; completed
rezone                                  # completed: nothing
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # completed: no section: 914
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
